<title>UK: Trocadero hires ex-First Leisure executives.</title>
<headline>Trocadero hires ex-First Leisure executives.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>British entertainment group Trocadero Plc on Thursday named former First Leisure Corp Plc chief executive John Conlan as its chairman, beginning in September.</p>
</text>
